OL,3,GNEWSAResidents still out of homes as
OL,4,Asecurity alert continues
OL,5,
OL,6,FA security alert in Ballymena, County
OL,7,FAntrim, is ongoing with residents still
OL,8,Fout of their homes since Friday
OL,9,Fevening.
OL,11,FPolice were called to the Moorfields
OL,12,FRoad area shortly before 20:45 GMT.
OL,14,FA cordon was put in place near the main
OL,15,Froad between Ballymena and Moorfields
OL,16,Fvillage. Two houses were evacuated.
OL,18,FMembers of the public, including
OL,19,Fdrivers, were advised to avoid the
OL,20,Farea.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
